message: "If you use this code, data or records, please cite them as below."
title: "Which Coordinates, Not How Many: Matched-Count Evidence on the PGD–FGSM Gap in a Vision–Language Model"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cavaletto
    given-names: Federico
repository-code: "https://github.com/fcavaletto/vlm-crossmodal-attack-transfer"
url: "https://github.com/fcavaletto/vlm-crossmodal-attack-transfer"
license:
